{"id":"ce77fe15277cd4ae050e8027247a9bd76fb0400a","axis":"silent","repo":"rustwasm/wasm-bindgen","sha":"ce77fe15277cd4ae050e8027247a9bd76fb0400a","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -5,6 +5,18 @@"," "," ### Added"," ","+* Under `js_sys_unstable_apis`, `Date::new_with_value` creates a `Date`","+  from a time value or a date string (`impl JsNumberOrStringLike`), and","+  `ArrayBuffer` converts to and from bytes: `ArrayBuffer::to_vec`,","+  `From<&[u8]>` and `From<Vec<u8>>` for `ArrayBuffer`, and","+  `From<ArrayBuffer>` / `From<&ArrayBuffer>` for `Vec<u8>`.","+  [#5446](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5446)","+","+* Added the `#[wasm_bindgen(no_from_js_value)]` attribute for imported types,","+  which omits the generated unchecked `From<JsValue>` impl so that a type can","+  provide its own.","+  [#5446](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5446)","+"," * Added `aarch64-pc-windows-msvc` release artifacts.","   [#5439](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5439)"," ","@@ -40,6 +52,30 @@","   `temporal` feature.","   [#5417](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5417)"," ","+* **Breaking (experimental):** under `js_sys_unstable_apis`, small built-in","+  string results return `String` rather than `JsString`: `Error::message`,","+  `name` and `to_string`, `Date::to_iso_string`, `to_string`,","+  `to_date_string`, `to_time_string` and `to_utc_string`,","+  `Number::to_fixed`, `to_precision`, `to_exponential` and","+  `to_string_with_radix`, `RegExp::source`, `flags` and `to_string`,","+  `Function::name`, `Symbol::to_string`, the `format` methods of","+  `Intl.DateTimeFormat`, `NumberFormat`, `ListFormat`, `RelativeTimeFormat`","+  and `DurationFormat`, the `format_range` methods of `Intl.DateTimeFormat`","+  and `NumberFormat`, and the string fields of the `Intl` resolved options","+  and format parts. `Date::to_json` returns `Option<String>`, `None` for an","+  invalid date. `JSON::stringify` and `JSON::stringify_with_replacer` return","+  `Result<Option<String>, JsValue>`, `None` for a value with no JSON form","+  such as `undefined`, and the replacer receives the key as a `String`.","+  [#5446](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5446)","+","+* **Breaking (experimental):** under `js_sys_unstable_apis`, `From<JsValue>`","+  for `Error` and its subclasses (`TypeError`, `RangeError`,","+  `WebAssembly::RuntimeError`, …) is no longer an unchecked cast. A caught","+  exception or a promise rejection can be any JS value, so a value without a","+  string `message` and `name` is wrapped in a new error of that type, with","+  the value as its `cause`. `unchecked_into` remains the unchecked cast.","+  [#5446](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5446)","+"," * The experimental `#[wasm_bindgen(experimental_tokio)]` support targets the","   hosted event loop of the current Tokio patchset (`1.54.1-cf.emscripten`),","   which ticks itself from host callbacks and needs Emscripten 6.0.12 or"],"additions":36,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/cli/tests/reference/wasm-export-colon.js","lines":["@@ -291,7 +291,7 @@ function __wbg_get_imports() {","         __wbg_log_d4d40eabd852060b: function(arg0, arg1) {","             console.log(getStringFromWasm0(arg0, arg1));","         },","-        __wbg_message_43d8c8f1d543a349: function(arg0) {","+        __wbg_message_f2ae48bd0e25bee9: function(arg0) {","             const ret = arg0.message;","             return ret;","         },","@@ -302,7 +302,7 @@ function __wbg_get_imports() {","             getDataViewMemory0().setInt32((arg0 >>> 0) + 4 * 1, len1, true);","             getDataViewMemory0().setInt32((arg0 >>> 0) + 4 * 0, ptr1, true);","         },","-        __wbg_name_d1fa514fdca6a975: function(arg0) {","+        __wbg_name_d89a83bfb104a27b: function(arg0) {","             const ret = arg0.name;","             return ret;","         },"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false